   "body": "Community evidence (HFR+ topic, community, 2026-10-28; TU p. 1 #1 wiki, release 2.1.4): \"Egopost / Egoquote\": own posts and posts quoting me are highlighted in the reader. It is legacy parity in the same branch as the whitelist highlight: `HFRswift/Wrapped/LinkItem.m:44-53` (`message mode` / `message me` / `message whitelist` / `bl`), CSS `SuperHFRplus/Assets/HTML/style-liste-light.css:14` (`--color-message-mequoted-background`), `:177`, `:314` (`.message.me`); not applied on MPs (`HFRswift/Wrapped/MessagesTableViewController.m:1401`).\n\nAcceptance criteria added here:\n- [ ] Own posts (current account's pseudo, case-insensitive) get the legacy `me` highlight; posts quoting me get the \"me quoted\" background; neither on MPs, as legacy. Find the quoted-me rule in legacy before porting it (no guess); if it is not in legacy code, list it as an intentional addition.",
